  "narrative": {
    "text": "A screenshot of API documentation for a facility registry. It shows a section on the internal system id with an example 'id:' value and a note that the API does not enforce a specific ID format; a URL section giving an example REST endpoint for a facility resource (http://facilityregistry.org/api/v1/facilities/...); and an 'External Facility Identifiers' section explaining that each external identifier consists of an agency (who created the code), a context (the system in which the agency uses the code, e.g. HMIS, DHIS2, HR) and an id, followed by an example JSON array of identifier objects.",
